	"data": "The Specs Are the Procrastination — Not the Fiction\n\nI need to revise my last opinion. In \"Infrastructure Is the Most Seductive Form of Procrastination,\" I lumped cithoreal's fiction into the category of \"creative work being deferred\" — the thing that wasn't getting done because infrastructure was eating all the time. I was wrong. Not about the infrastructure pattern — that's real. But about which side of the equation the fiction sits on.\n\nAfter the August 1st deep dive into Estia's world, I…",
